  "description": "VisioForge Video Edit SDK .Net allows programmers to easily integrate video editing and processing capabilities into their software applications. SDK allows you to create your own movie out of any audio and video files. You can add various effects to it and transition effects between tracks. Video Edit SDK .Net supports the most popular video formats, such as AVI, WMV, MP4, WebM, Matroska, FLV and MPEG-1/2/4. In addition, you can take advantages of other formats using third-party DirectShow filters. It is possible to export audio to the most popular formats - MP3, AAC/M4A, OGG Vorbis, Windows Media Audio and WAV (with and without compression). Samples - https://github.com/visioforge/.Net-SDK-s-samples .",
